		(property "BOM Comments" "1=GND; 2=EXT_VCC continuous protected 5V; 3=tach NC; 4=FAN_PWM_5V; MP=GND. JST GH requires a suitable cable/adaptor for a PC fan plug. A two-wire fan uses pins 1/2 and runs whenever 5V_SYS is powered. For PWM use a 5V fan documented to stop at 0% duty, e.g. NF-A4x20 5V PWM. Never use a 12V fan."
